      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00462",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "忽然，女人用沙哑的没有抑扬的声音说，好像闭合上的两片蚌壳，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Suddenly, the woman said in a hoarse, flat voice, like two clam shells closed together,",
